id: P-add-skill
name: Add a new skill
description: Create a new Claude Code plugin skill with SKILL.md
trigger:
  - add skill
  - new skill
  - create skill
  - add slash command
  - new prompt
tags:
  - skill
  - plugin
  - claude-code
symbols:
  - '#protocol-skill'
  - '#lore-skill'
exemplar: plugins/paradigm/skills/lore/SKILL.md
steps:
  - action: create
    target: plugins/paradigm/skills/{name}/SKILL.md
    template_from: plugins/paradigm/skills/lore/SKILL.md
    notes: YAML frontmatter with name + description, then markdown instructions. Description is what triggers the skill.
  - action: verify
    notes: Ensure the skill name and description match a user-triggerable phrase. The skill auto-registers from the directory structure.
